            <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;For task(s) selected in AYON tree, add Container(s)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* make sure the container is not present already&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* for selected task, create user name: &amp;quot;{leaf folder name}:{task name}&amp;quot;. The unique container name is &amp;quot;{folder path}:{task name}&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* find container placement in the Nuke Node Graph&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* load template nuke nodes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* use AYON loader to load templated nodes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* replace (connect) template nuke nodes (placeholders) with nodes loaded from AYON&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Create Nuke BackDrop to uncapsluate the nodes to a &amp;quot;container&amp;quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Add metadata knobs to the container backdrop for future Inventory purposes&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
           </property>
           <property name="text">
            <string>Add Container</string>
           </property>
